OL,3,GNEWSAEU food check cut risks health and
OL,4,Ajobs - council                         
OL,6,FThe official in charge of the main     
OL,7,Finspection post for food arriving      
OL,8,Fthrough Dover has warned scrapping     
OL,9,Fpost-Brexit border checks would be "a  
OL,10,Frisk to public health".                
OL,12,FAnthony Baldock, of the Ashford Port   
OL,13,FHealth Authority, claims the checks are
OL,14,Fpart of the reason the UK remains free 
OL,15,Fof most animal diseases.               
OL,17,FHis comments come after the leader of  
OL,18,FAshford Borough Council wrote to the   
OL,19,Fgovernment warning a planned UK-EU deal
OL,20,Fcould put about 1,500 jobs at risk in  
OL,21,FKent.                                  
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
